ation.</p></div></div><div class=\"p-5 pt-0 space-y-3\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\"><span class=\"text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-800/80 text-slate-300 border border-slate-700/60 font-mono\">#<!-- -->IoT</span><span class=\"text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-800/80 text-slate-300 border border-slate-700/60 font-mono\">#<!-- -->Smart Relay</span><span class=\"text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-800/80 text-slate-300 border border-slate-700/60 font-mono\">#<!-- -->Home Automation</span><span class=\"text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-800/80 text-slate-300 border border-slate-700/60 font-mono\">#<!-- -->Sensor Triggers</span></div><button class=\"w-full py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-cyan-500 hover:text-slate-950 text-slate-300 font-bold text-xs transition-all duration-300 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 border border-slate-700 hover:border-cyan-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-video w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m16 13 5.223 3.482a.5.5 0 0 0 .777-.416V7.87a.5.5 0 0 0-.752-.432L16 10.5\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"6\" width=\"14\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg> Watch Video Story</button></div></div><div class=\"group bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800/80 hover:border-cyan-500/50 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl hover:shadow-cyan-500/10 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.95)\"><div><div class=\"relative h-48 w-full bg-slate-950 overflow-hidden cursor-pointer\"><img src=\"/assets/training/lv_0_20260312113248.png\" alt=\"Autonomous Obstacle-Avoiding Mobile Robot\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105 opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t fr